{{Quote|Contact Morgan. Tell her I believe we have located the reflex point on Seatos.|Baylan Skoll, to Shin Hati|<ref name="Part two" />}}
The '''Seatos reflex point'''<ref name="Part two" /> was a [[henge]]<ref name="Part four" /> that was built on the [[planet]] [[Seatos]] by an [[Dathomirian|ancient people]] from [[Far galaxy|another galaxy]] long<ref name="Part two" /> before [[9 ABY]]. In that year,<ref name="Date">{{AhsokaSeriesDate}}</ref> [[Morgan Elsbeth]], [[Baylan Skoll]], and [[Shin Hati]] used the reflex point to see a [[Arcana Star Map|star map]] that showed the [[Pathway to Peridea]], where it was believed that [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] could be found.<ref name="Part two" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Production photos reveal that the [[Unidentified runic alphabet|runes]] carved into the [[henge]] at the Seatos reflex point translate as: "Twenty one hundred [[Megalight per hour|megalight]] [[parsec]]s."<ref name="Frances Lebar">{{WebCite|url=https://www.franceslebar.com/ahsoka|text=Seatos behind-the-scenes production photos|author=[[Frances Lebar]]|date=2023-10-29|archivedate=20231029041319}}</ref>

